the restated types in ports/agent-runtime-sessions.ts (C6 landed them and proved the real runtime satisfies them). Types only; tsc is the
proof (the real attach functions still flow into them). Step 7 needed no change: ai-trace-lifecycle.ts and event-translation.ts already
import createAiTraceRecorder / normalizeAiUsage from core (C6).

